
# 2025-12-03 13:02:44.795061
+Code the following app
+```
+Create a one-page mini-app called WishPool where users can make wishlists, add items to them, and let others show support. Users should be able to create a wishlist with a title and description, see a list of public wishlists, open one to view its items, and add new items. When an item is opened, users should see its details and send simple support messages. All views should stay on one page, and users can switch between browsing wishlists, viewing a wishlist, and viewing an item. The mini-app should include all these features in a simple layout.
+```
+
+Generate an app logo and update the app metadata title and description.

